Z||000000||FieroRyan||09-14-2001||02:14 AM||||I just made this in Notepad, and I figured you guys could tell me the cheapest/best way to get what I need/want.  Also, some details on the engines and their positive/negatives would be nice  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  Thanks!<P><BR>P.S.  Remember I'm a poor teenager, I have very little $$...  but all of it's going into the car!<P>-----------<P>1986 Fiero 2m4<P>Have:<BR>Mr. Mikes two-tone (tan/black) leather seats (9/10/01)<BR>Leather shift knob (9/14/01)<BR>Black paint job (9/03/01)<BR>Bra (9/10/01)<BR>Soundstorm 4x10 speakers (07/24/01)<BR>Pioneer 45x4 CD player (07/24/01)<BR>4x6 Legacy speakers (08/01)<P>Need:<BR>K & N Air filter<BR>New exhaust (dual)<BR>Shortened shifter<P>Want:<BR>Better engine (V6?  V8?  Quad 4?)<BR>New rims/tires<BR>Isuzu 5-speed tranny<BR>Eurostyle taillights<BR>Hood scoop<BR>Side scoops<BR>Spoiler<BR>Chin spoiler<BR>||||reg||1
